<title>USA: Phillips Petroleum Co Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Phillips Petroleum Co Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BARTLESVILLE, Okla. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary	    $  0.76		  $  0.42</p>
<p> Net			200,000		  109,000</p>
<p> Revs		   4,333,000		3,346,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     263,232		  262,092</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr primary	     $ 4.96		  $  1.79</p>
<p> Net		    1,303,303		  469,000</p>
<p> Revs		  15,807,000	     13,521,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     262,919		  261,989</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>First Call Mean estimate for Q4 was $0.99 per share.</p>
<p>First Call Mean estimate for Year was $3.40 per share.</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 Net includes special items charge of $52 million related to an impairment associated with the Point Arguello field and impairment of certain retail service stations in an expansion program.</p>
<p>1996 year net includes gain of $565 million in Q1 from the resolution of a tax case involving the firm's Kenai, Alaska, liquefied natural gas facility.</p>
<p>Excluding the gain, 1996 oper net was $891 million vs $580 million.</p>
</text>
